skeleton ESP. There are team check and rainbow color options.\n\nTriggerbot automatically fires when the crosshair is on a valid target. Settings include fire delay, activation chance, and maximum distance. Team and wall checks are supported for accuracy.\n\nPlayer Modifications include movement tools like walkspeed modes (Default, CFrame, Heatseeker), infinite jump, fly mode with adjustable speed, and NoClip. Combat and utility features include multiple fling types (Regular, Walk Fling, Anti-Fling, Invisible Fling), spinbot for fast character rotation, and click-to-teleport using a keybind.\n\nAutomation and Waypoints allow users to create and manage waypoints for automated movement. Looping paths can be used for farming or patrols. It supports auto actions like attack, collect, and interact with filter options.\n\nWorld Customization features include FullBright, NoFog, custom gravity, time, and skybox settings. Users can also adjust fog, ambient lighting, and brightness, and remove textures for performance or visual preference.\n\nBlatant Features include teleporting to players, spectate mode with an option to stop spectating, and a staff detector that flags moderators or admins.\n\nMiscellaneous tools include an Anti-AFK to prevent idle disconnection, a motion blur visual effect, and a button to rejoin the server quickly.\n\nUI and Settings offer a clean acrylic-blur interface with customizable notifications and user info. A credits section includes a Discord support link. The script supports auto-saving settings, webhook tracking, and has built-in logging for debugging and security.\n\nSoluna Universal balances subtle enhancements with more aggressive exploit features across various Roblox games.","tags":["Aimbot","ESP","Triggerbot","Player","AutoFarm"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68179ef4c85e8a760f2bdfff","username":"alwaysmesmerizingyou","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8a319e9e2a1b48397f763f7a0ccabf8a5f84f3625720